description	"Captain Quarsh Panaka

A commander who builds resource through damage to bolster his allies and himself.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Naboo S-5 Blaster Pistol (3)
-- 15% faster RoF
-- 10% more damage/FP drain
- CR-2 Heavy Blaster Pistol (3)
-- 10% more damage/FP drain
- Frag Grenade (3)
- V-59 Conc Grenade (3)

^5Powers:
- Urban Energize (2)
- Urban Protect (1) ^7{Security's Beacon}
- Urban Rage (1)

^6Inventory:
- Advanced Medpac

^8Attributes:
- Fury (3)
-- Regen: 1/.1s to 15
-- 99% slower decay
- Dexterity (1)
- Healing (2)
- Rally
- Ally Stat Viewer
- 50% slower skill cooldown

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Dash (2) ^3[CS2]
- Quick Throw (1) ^3[CS3]
- Grappling Hook (1) ^3[Melee CS4]"